From ffb44749e89e1a8925e47d4d8d32111d9c848d03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Henderson <markh@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 13:19:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [REMIX-5053] Addressing UI feedback

* fixes texture menu width
* swaps to more readable NVIDIASansMd font
* fixes collapsingHeader arrow direction
* tweak border size and transparency for better contrast (to match toolkit styles)
* change wording of layer management buttons
* Remove the separate label tooltip in RtxOption Widgets, so the entire widget gets the full tooltip.
* Add a persistant option to always unblock when editing blocked RtxOptions
* Invoke the blocked option popup when trying to reset blocked options.
